  "stem": "The speaker only asks for information: 'Do you know who called the office?' Why is 'who did call' not used?",
  "options": [
    "Because called is an adjective",
    "Because who is the subject of the verb called",
    "Because the office is the subject",
    "Because indirect questions cannot ask about people"
  ],
  "answerIndex": 1,
  "optionRationales": [
    {
      "optionIndex": 0,
      "isCorrect": false,
      "reason": "called 在此是過去動詞，不是形容詞。"
    },
    {
      "optionIndex": 1,
      "isCorrect": true,
      "reason": "who 代表打電話的人，已擔任 called 的主詞，所以不需 did。"
    },
    {
      "optionIndex": 2,
      "isCorrect": false,
      "reason": "office 是接到電話的受詞。"
    },
    {
      "optionIndex": 3,
      "isCorrect": false,
      "reason": "間接問句當然可以用 who 詢問人物。"
    }
  ],
